hi Naveed,
 it appears that the covariate values are changing and thus you would expect slightly different estimates of parameters.  This line right here simulates normal covariate values:

obsCovs(pferUMF1) <- data.frame(obsvar1 = rnorm(numSites(pferUMF1) * obsNum(pferUMF1)))

regards,
andy

