those results look reasonable. It appears that 100% of the sites have detections and therefore psi = 1.0.  The differences in the MLEs are just numerical differences which exist because the MLE is on the boundary of the parameter space (my opinion).  I suggest repeating this but with a reasonable value of psi so that not all of the sites appear to be occupied. In that case, you should get precisely the same MLEs by rearranging the occasions.
regards
andy

